We may not realize the full benefits of the cost savings, synergies, revenue enhancements, or other benefits that we may have expected at the time of acquisition, at the time of integration and rebranding, or on the timeframe expected. Also, the cost savings and other benefits may be offset by unexpected costs incurred in integrating CFI, increases in other expenses, or problems in the business unrelated to this acquisition.

